    "title": "World Baseball Classic schedule 2026: Dates, times, channels, live streams, scores for every WBC game",
    "text": "World Baseball Classic schedule 2026: Dates, times, channels, live streams, scores for every WBC game originally appeared on The Sporting News. Add The Sporting News as a Preferred Source by clicking here.The World Baseball Classic is back, with some of the best players on the planet representing their country instead of their MLB team with national pride on the line.AdvertisementThe most recent WBC in 2023 lived up to the name, with Japan edging Team USA in an electric championship game in Miami to secure the trophy for the third time in five editions of the Classic.Led once again by Shohei Ohtani, Japan has to be the favorite entering the 2026 tournament. After finishing either first or third in every WBC to date, the Japanese know what it takes to succeed in this format.Team USA will be formidable, though, with Aaron Judge, Kyle Schwarber and Paul Skenes leading a talented group for manager Mark DeRosa and trying to add a trophy after winning in 2017. The only other nation to take the WBC crown was the Dominican Republic in 2013, and the D.R. is stacked again this year behind the likes of Vladimir Guerrero Jr., Juan Soto, Julio Rodriguez, Manny Machado and more.Will one of the favorites emerge on top or will a team like Venezuela, Mexico or Korea break through? Here's everything you need to know to watch all the games.AdvertisementWednesday, March 4GameTime (ET)TV/StreamAustralia 3, Chinese Taipei 0——Thursday, March 5GameTime (ET)TV/StreamKorea 11, Czechia 4——Australia 5, Czechia 1——Friday, March 6GameTime (ET)TV/StreamJapan 13, Chinese Taipei 0 (7 inn.)——Cuba 3, Panama 1——Venezuela 6, Netherlands 2——Mexico 8, Great Britain 2——Puerto Rico 5, Colombia 0——Dominican Republic 12, Nicaragua 3——USA 15, Brazil 5——Chinese Taipei 14, Czechia 0 (7 inn.)——Saturday, March 7GameTime (ET)TV/StreamJapan 8, Korea 6——Canada 8, Colombia 2——Netherlands 4, Nicaragua 3——Italy 8, Brazil 0——Puerto Rico 4, Panama 3 (10 inn.)——Venezuela 11, Israel 3——USA 9, Great Britain 1——Chinese Taipei 5, Korea 4 (10 inn.)——Sunday, March 8GameTime (ET)TV/StreamJapan 4, Australia 3——Cuba 7, Colombia 4——Dominican Republic 12, Netherlands 1 (7 inn.)——Italy 7, Great Britain 4——Israel 5, Nicaragua 0——Panama 4, Canada 3——Mexico 16, Brazil 0 (6 inn.)——Monday, March 9GameTime (ET)TV/StreamKorea 7, Australia 2——Dominican Republic 10, Israel 1——Colombia 4, Panama 3——Great Britain 8, Brazil 1——Puerto Rico 4, Cuba 1——Venezuela 4, Nicaragua 0——USA 5, Mexico 3——Tuesday, March 10GameTime (ET)TV/StreamJapan 9, Czechia 0——Israel 6, Netherlands 2——Canada 3, Puerto Rico 2——Italy 8, USA 6——Wednesday, March 11GameTime (ET)TV/StreamCanada 7, Cuba 2——Italy 9, Mexico 1——Dominican Republic 7, Venezuela 5——Friday, March 13 - QuarterfinalsGameTime (ET)TV/StreamDominican Republic 10, Korea 0 (7 inn.)——USA 5, Canada 3——Saturday, March 14 - QuarterfinalsGameTime (ET)TV/StreamItaly 8, Puerto Rico 6——Venezuela 8, Japan 5——Sunday, March 15 - SemifinalsSemifinals and championship will be played in MiamiGameTime (ET)TV/StreamUSA 2, Dominican Republic 1——Monday, March 16 - SemifinalsGameTime (ET)TV/StreamItaly vs. Venezuela8 p.m.FS1, FuboTuesday, March 17 - ChampionshipGameTime (ET)TV/StreamUSA vs. Italy/Venezuela8 p.m.Fox, FuboWhere to watch World Baseball Classic 2026TV channels: Fox, FS1, FS2Live stream: Fubo, Tubi, Fox app, Fox OneThe 2026 World Baseball Classic will be broadcast by the Fox networks, including the main channel, FS1 and FS2. All of those games can be streamed live via Fubo, and some additional games will stream on Tubi and the Fox app. Fox One will also stream every game.AdvertisementFubo offers a free trial for new subscribers, so you can try the service before you buy. Stream ESPN, ABC, CBS, Fox and 100+ top channels of live TV and sports without cable. (Participating plans only. Taxes and fees may apply.)World Baseball Classic radio coverage 2026Fans can listen to every 2026 World Baseball Classic game live on SiriusXM.New subscribers can listen to SiriusXM for free for four months. Listen to live NFL, MLB, NBA and NHL games, plus NASCAR, college sports and more. Stay updated with all the news and get all the analysis on multiple sport-specific channels.World Baseball Classic pools 2026The preliminary round at the 2026 WBC will be played in four pools of five teams each:AdvertisementPool A teamsGames at Hiram Bithorn Stadium in San JuanPuerto RicoCubaCanadaPanamaColombiaPool B teamsGames at Daikin Park in HoustonUSAMexicoItalyGreat BritainBrazilPool C teamsGames at Tokyo DomeJapanAustraliaKoreaCzechiaChinese TaipeiPool D teamsGames at loanDepot Park in MiamiVenezuelaDominican RepublicNetherlandsIsraelNicaraguaWorld Baseball Classic winners listHere are the winners and runners-up for the first five editions of the WBC.YearChampionRunner-up2023JapanUnited States2017United StatesPuerto Rico2013Dominican RepublicPuerto Rico2009JapanSouth Korea2006JapanCubaRelated Links",
